Workflow edits from the container work that the session's GitHub token was
not allowed to push (OAuth apps need the 'workflow' scope). Apply with:

    git apply docs/pending-workflow-changes.patch && git rm docs/pending-workflow-changes.patch

- container-release.yml: publish the -full image too, pass NETLAB_GUI_VERSION,
  and fix the release-notes docker command (lowercase image, no 'v' in tag).
- ci.yml: build both Dockerfile targets (ui, full) on PRs.

